comctl32: hide an active tracking tooltip before deleting its tool.

Photoshop removes its document-tab tool before deactivating tracking. Hiding
only nCurrentTool leaves the tracking window visible, then clearing nTrackTool
prevents the subsequent TTM_TRACKACTIVATE(FALSE) from dismissing it.

--- a/dlls/comctl32/tooltips.c
+++ b/dlls/comctl32/tooltips.c
@@ -1203,6 +1203,11 @@
 
     /* make sure the tooltip has disappeared before deleting it */
     TOOLTIPS_Hide(infoPtr);
+    if (infoPtr->nTrackTool == nTool)
+    {
+        TOOLTIPS_TrackHide(infoPtr);
+        infoPtr->bTrackActive = FALSE;
+    }
 
     toolPtr = &infoPtr->tools[nTool];
     TOOLTIPS_FreeToolText (toolPtr);
